        "created_at": "2015-01-14T08:26:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That definitely shouldn't happen. We've looked into that and created a new, fixed version. Please make sure you download Version 7.3 as soon as it's available. Thanks for the input! :)</p><p><span>In other news, we just managed to get the new version out to the Amazon App Store for those on Kindle devices.</span></p>",
