        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T04:00:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>More good news!</p><p>We have just released the newest version of SotM Commander (8.0).</p><p>This version includes all the fixes to the decks from above, as well as the ability to create custom decks with cards that are indestructible, automatically added on game start, and hidden from the sorted view. (For reference, the Unlucky Pool for Setback is all three of those things)</p><p>We hope you enjoy the new features!</p>",
