        "id": 95937,
        "name": "tarsonas",
        "username": "tarsonas",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T04:11:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Awesome. That makes some of my custom characters very happy. Thanks for the quick update. Love this app a lot. Even though there are no pictures, the way it is set up makes it easier to use. Plus customs can have there own space for there own stuff. The only thing I can think of to add is a way to quickly tell who has the highest and who has the lowest, but no need for that right now. Thanks and keep up the great work</p>",
