      {
        "id": 95938,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T05:08:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\">I'm not seeing Omnitron IV. &nbsp;Is that just me?</span></p>\n<p>nevermind. &nbsp;That was just me.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>One thing though. &nbsp;The Partial Omni-drone immediately drops to 5 HP when it comes into play. &nbsp;I don't suppose you could tweak the app so that you don't have to drop it 25 hp manually?</p>",
