      {
        "id": 95939,
        "name": "nispesoft",
        "username": "nispesoft",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-23T07:22:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of course! We didn't think of that when we were entering all the new card data, but we will have an update that corrects that in the near future. Keep your eye on the Play and Amazon Store updates over the next week or so. We'll also post another forum update when it's ready to go. Thanks for all the errata, we try to get as much right as we can, but nobody's perfect. :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>As for finding the highest and lowest HP, if you are looking at the main battle screen and flick to the left, you'll see a list of all the cards played, sorted by HP (from lowest to highest). You can use the checkboxes at the top to disable the different types of cards to easily find the highest villain card, or the lowest hero card, or the second-lowest non-environment card, etc. If you uncheck the green H, you'll hide hero cards, if you uncheck the red V, you'll hide the villain cards, and if you uncheck the blue E, you'll hide the environment cards.</span></p><p>You can also edit the HP of targets right on the sorted HP screen. Just press Reorder at the top when you're done changing the values and it'll sort with the new HP values.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks again for all your support!</p>",
