        "id": 95940,
        "name": "nispesoft",
        "username": "nispesoft",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-30T06:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for your patience!</p><p><span>Sorry it took the whole week, but a small update to start Partial Omni-Drone at 5 HP instead of 30 HP has just been uploaded to the Google Play Store and Amazon Store. It should be available for download within the next 24 hours or so.</span></p><p><span>Thanks for the tip, and we hope you continue to enjoy using our app!</span></p>",
