        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-06T05:24:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi Everyone!</p><p>Just letting everyone know that the latest expansion \"Villains of the Multiverse\", and all the new promo cards have been added to our app!</p><p>The new version should be available on both the Google Play Store and the Amazon App Store within the next 24 hours.</p><p>As always, if you encounter any issues, please let us know at <a href=\"mailto:sotm@nispesoft.com\">sotm@nispesoft.com</a></p><p>I hope you're enjoying the new cards as much as we are!</p>",
